WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.967 --> 00:00:02.201
-Now, Carrie, since your book

00:00:02.201 --> 00:00:03.903
is all about getting
healthy and fit,

00:00:03.903 --> 00:00:06.206
I thought it'd be fun
if we played a new fitness game.

00:00:06.206 --> 00:00:10.243
It's time for "Tonight Show"
Fittest of the Fit Challenge.

00:00:10.243 --> 00:00:14.414
-♪ You wanna get fit,
you wanna get fit ♪

00:00:14.414 --> 00:00:16.615
♪ Fittest of the Fit ♪

00:00:16.615 --> 00:00:20.386
-All right. Our first challenge
is called the hang ten.

00:00:20.386 --> 00:00:23.723
We have to race along
this course matching our hands

00:00:23.723 --> 00:00:26.892
and feet exactly
to the pictures on the floor.

00:00:26.892 --> 00:00:28.962
The first one to finish
wins the round.

00:00:28.962 --> 00:00:30.997
Okay? Do you understand?
-Yeah.

00:00:30.997 --> 00:00:32.665
-All right.
You -- Are you ready?

00:00:32.665 --> 00:00:35.268
Have you ever done anything like
this before in your lifetime?

00:00:35.268 --> 00:00:36.903
-Never.
-Yeah, me neither.

00:00:36.903 --> 00:00:39.472
Maybe, like, "Dance Dance
Revolution" meets Twister.

00:00:39.472 --> 00:00:40.840
It's really fun.
-Ooh, you're one up on me.

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:42.908
-All right, but I don't think
I'm going to win.

00:00:42.908 --> 00:00:45.111
But either way. Hey, confidence.
Confidence is key.

00:00:45.111 --> 00:00:46.479
All right. Here we go.
All right. You ready?

00:00:46.479 --> 00:00:49.315
Let's line up. [Blows]
All right. On your -- Wait.

00:00:49.315 --> 00:00:53.686
I just want to see what --
On your mark, get set, go!

00:00:53.686 --> 00:00:56.355
-Aah!

00:00:56.355 --> 00:00:58.491
♪♪

00:00:58.491 --> 00:01:00.192
-Oh, God!

00:01:00.192 --> 00:01:02.228
Oh, God! This is so hard!

00:01:02.228 --> 00:01:04.564
-Aah!
-Oh, my God! You're killing me!

00:01:04.564 --> 00:01:07.066
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:07.066 --> 00:01:08.968
-[ Laughs ]
-Oh, my God!

00:01:08.968 --> 00:01:10.837
♪♪

00:01:10.837 --> 00:01:13.272
[ Bell dings ]
-Whoo!

00:01:13.272 --> 00:01:14.841
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:14.841 --> 00:01:17.710
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:17.710 --> 00:01:21.681
God. That was so embarrassing!
Oh, my gosh.

00:01:21.681 --> 00:01:23.883
-That was harder than
you would think it would be.

00:01:23.883 --> 00:01:26.119
-It really is tough, man.
Can we see that again?

00:01:26.119 --> 00:01:27.587
Why? In slow motion. Here we go.

00:01:27.587 --> 00:01:29.822
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:29.822 --> 00:01:31.257
♪♪

00:01:31.257 --> 00:01:33.760
-Oh, my gosh. It was that bad?

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:36.329
Oh, my gosh.
What are you doing?

00:01:36.329 --> 00:01:38.130
-It's beautiful.

00:01:38.130 --> 00:01:40.633
-Now it is time --
I'm like -- Wow. Just clueless.

00:01:40.633 --> 00:01:43.002
I'm like, "Hand, foot, what?"

00:01:43.002 --> 00:01:44.870
Now it's time
for our second challenge.

00:01:44.870 --> 00:01:48.107
This is called the Bodzilla.
-Yeah!

00:01:48.107 --> 00:01:50.009
-And this time, we're
going to be working together.

00:01:50.009 --> 00:01:52.712
One of us will put on a
blindfold and attempt to walk

00:01:52.712 --> 00:01:55.515
through this tiny city
without knocking over

00:01:55.515 --> 00:01:57.650
or crushing
any of the buildings...

00:01:57.650 --> 00:02:00.019
while the other
has to hold a plank

00:02:00.019 --> 00:02:03.222
and guide them by shouting out
where they should step.

00:02:03.222 --> 00:02:07.459
Who's doing the, uh --
Who's doing the planking?

00:02:07.459 --> 00:02:11.030
Since you won the last round...

00:02:11.030 --> 00:02:12.865
-I --
That doesn't help, does it?

00:02:12.865 --> 00:02:14.300
-No, it doesn't. Yeah.

00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:16.502
It means you will be walking
blindfolded through the city.

00:02:16.502 --> 00:02:18.203
And I have to do
a plank push-up?

00:02:18.203 --> 00:02:20.907
-Just hold a plank.
-Just walk really -- Just jump.

00:02:20.907 --> 00:02:22.608
[ Laughter ]

00:02:22.608 --> 00:02:25.110
Just take a real --
Just start running from there...

00:02:25.110 --> 00:02:26.879
-You know, I'm 5'3",
and I have super --

00:02:26.879 --> 00:02:28.648
I don't -- I'm not tall.
-You can do this.

00:02:28.648 --> 00:02:29.949
-I don't know if I can --
-Oh, my gosh.

00:02:29.949 --> 00:02:31.484
-Blindfolded. But sure.
-Aw, bud, you can do this.

00:02:31.484 --> 00:02:32.785
All right. You go over there.
-Okay.

00:02:32.785 --> 00:02:35.021
-And I'll go down here.
And then -- Here we go.

00:02:35.021 --> 00:02:36.822
It's all about --
-Okay.

00:02:36.822 --> 00:02:38.825
[ Drum roll ]

00:02:38.825 --> 00:02:40.660
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:40.660 --> 00:02:42.828
-Ready? On your mark, get set.

00:02:42.828 --> 00:02:44.597
All right.
Left, left foot, left foot.

00:02:44.597 --> 00:02:46.099
Go! Left foot.
All right, right foot.

00:02:46.099 --> 00:02:47.567
Straight up in the air.
Right foot.

00:02:47.567 --> 00:02:49.035
Straight up in the air.
Straight up.

00:02:49.035 --> 00:02:51.003
Yes, yes, yes, perfect! Wow!

00:02:51.003 --> 00:02:53.439
Left foot. You're great.
All right. Now right foot.

00:02:53.439 --> 00:02:55.975
Big, big, big, big -- Yes.

00:02:55.975 --> 00:02:58.377
No, no. Yes.
No! Yes! Yes! Perfect!

00:02:58.377 --> 00:03:01.381
All right. Left foot. Yes.
That's -- Stop right there!

00:03:01.381 --> 00:03:03.415
Just stop!
Just chill out for two seconds.

00:03:03.415 --> 00:03:05.784
All right.
Left foot up in the air.

00:03:05.784 --> 00:03:08.888
Now over, forward, forward.
Oh, higher, higher, higher!

00:03:08.888 --> 00:03:12.024
Forward. No, no, no!
No! Yeah, stop, stop!

00:03:12.024 --> 00:03:14.626
Now right foot.
Real big -- Giant step!

00:03:14.626 --> 00:03:16.262
Yes, and you're done!

00:03:16.262 --> 00:03:18.431
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:18.431 --> 00:03:20.567
-Whoo!

00:03:20.567 --> 00:03:23.169
-That was teamwork, man.
That was great.

00:03:23.169 --> 00:03:26.172
Now, can we see that again
in slow motion?

00:03:26.172 --> 00:03:28.407
-Yes!
-Yes!

00:03:28.407 --> 00:03:30.109
♪♪

00:03:30.109 --> 00:03:31.944
Look at that!
-Ooh!

00:03:31.944 --> 00:03:35.715
-Come on. Bodzilla.
That's what I'm talking about.

00:03:35.715 --> 00:03:38.585
It's time for the final round.
This is worth 10,000 points.

00:03:38.585 --> 00:03:41.454
-Whoa! I know.
They're worth points.

00:03:41.454 --> 00:03:44.590
-Whoever takes this round wins.
And this is a good one here.

00:03:44.590 --> 00:03:46.925
This is called
the Huff and Puff Face-Off.

00:03:46.925 --> 00:03:48.527
-What do I win?

00:03:48.527 --> 00:03:50.897
-We -- Uh -- Um --
-What's my motivation?

00:03:50.897 --> 00:03:53.265
-Bragging rights.
-Okay. That's enough.

00:03:53.265 --> 00:03:56.035
-You have to crouch down
into a bear crawl while trying

00:03:56.035 --> 00:04:00.038
to blow these three ping-pong
balls past the center line.

00:04:00.038 --> 00:04:04.309
Whoever has the most balls
in the other person's side

00:04:04.309 --> 00:04:06.279
after 20 seconds wins the game.

00:04:06.279 --> 00:04:09.081
Whew. I'm already out of breath.

00:04:09.081 --> 00:04:10.883
I haven't even done anything,
and I'm breathing heavy.

00:04:10.883 --> 00:04:13.219
What did I do?
Are you ready for this?

00:04:13.219 --> 00:04:14.687
-Let's do it.
-You go over there.

00:04:14.687 --> 00:04:16.155
And, hey, good luck. Hey.
-Good luck.

00:04:16.155 --> 00:04:18.124
May the best --
May the best man win.

00:04:18.124 --> 00:04:20.326
-Yeah, or woman.
-Or woman.

00:04:20.326 --> 00:04:22.261
-All right. Here we go.
Drum roll, please.

00:04:22.261 --> 00:04:23.696
[ Drum roll ]

00:04:23.696 --> 00:04:25.531
On your mark, get set, go!

00:04:25.531 --> 00:04:27.199
[ Both blowing ]

00:04:27.199 --> 00:04:29.735
-[ Shouts indistinctly ]

00:04:29.735 --> 00:04:33.572
♪♪

00:04:33.572 --> 00:04:36.208
[ Blowing continues ]

00:04:36.208 --> 00:04:39.245
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:39.245 --> 00:04:44.984
♪♪

00:04:44.984 --> 00:04:46.185
[ Bell dings ]

00:04:46.185 --> 00:04:47.720
-Yeah!

00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:49.956
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:55.294 --> 00:04:57.697
-I win!

00:04:57.697 --> 00:05:01.434
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:01.434 --> 00:05:03.035
-Carrie Underwood, everybody!

00:05:03.035 --> 00:05:05.371
[ Cheers and applause ]

